{"id":"f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-numeral-functional-representation.md","title":"Numeralwise Functional Representation","display":"lem-numeral-functional-representation — Numeralwise Functional Representation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-numeral-functional-representation","aliases":["88-lem-numeral-functional-representation"],"display":"lem-numeral-functional-representation — Numeralwise Functional Representation","depends_on":["[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-df-numeral]]","[[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[88-df-classical-calculus]]","[[88-df-theory]]","[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-representable-function]]","[[88-df-substitution]]","[[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-numeral-functional-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-numeral-functional-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-numeral-functional-representation — Numeralwise Functional Representation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b9c2b3bb904b3813\" href=\"?note=b9c2b3bb904b3813\" title=\"88-df-representable-function\">88-df-representable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d2dec526682fb65\" href=\"?note=5d2dec526682fb65\" title=\"88-df-kleene-t-predicate\">88-df-kleene-t-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为候选全函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_S\">\\(\\nu_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a> 的原七条公理。在条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 中采用同一符号与变量的句法包含。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k]\">\\(\\rho[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k]\\)</span> 是依次闭项代入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时为空代入。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepFn}\">\\(\\mathrm{RepFn}\\)</span> 的原定义仍是图关系逐数词可表示，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b9c2b3bb904b3813\" href=\"?note=b9c2b3bb904b3813\" title=\"88-df-representable-function\">88-df-representable-function</a>；本引理另行提供对角化实际需要的逐输入唯一输出公式，不重定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepFn}\">\\(\\mathrm{RepFn}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}functional\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\\bigr)\\\\\n\\to\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k,y)\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^{k+1}\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}_S(\\rho)=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k,y\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\bigwedge_{1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq k}x_i\\neq x_j\n\\land\\bigwedge_{1\\leq i\\leq k}x_i\\neq y\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\nT\\vdash_R\\forall y\\;\\bigl(\n\\rho[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k]\n\\leftrightarrow y=\\nu_S(f(\\vec n))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}functional\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\\bigr)\\\\\n\\to\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k,y)\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^{k+1}\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}_S(\\rho)=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k,y\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\bigwedge_{1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq k}x_i\\neq x_j\n\\land\\bigwedge_{1\\leq i\\leq k}x_i\\neq y\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\nT\\vdash_R\\forall y\\;\\bigl(\n\\rho[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k]\n\\leftrightarrow y=\\nu_S(f(\\vec n))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的机器，以有限运行的数值编码构造算术计算公式。每个固定标准输入上的实际停机计算是有限的；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 可验证它的各个数值步骤，并以确定性排除不同输出。选择逐输入唯一化的表示公式，得到显示的全称等价式。这里不主张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明对所有对象语言输入统一终止；那比逐标准输入的结论更强。</p>\n<p>所需计算公式可仅用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\mathsf s,+,\\cdot,=\">\\(0,\\mathsf s,+,\\cdot,=\\)</span> 构造，次序比较用这些符号的公式展开，故不需要原始关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 的附加公理。对空元输入及未实际使用的输入变量，补入恒真等式可保持显示的自由变量集合。</p>\n<p>对角代入函数只被原文要求可计算，未被要求原始递归；本引理正好补足这一断层。它与原来的原始递归图表示引理分别保留，不能把前者所需的唯一输出条件擅自塞进后者的定义接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"3f44d69945b890a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-classical-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"0aa80b611d62ec1b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-classical-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-representable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9c2b3bb904b3813","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-representable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"a72f024d8daeb569","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N$ 为候选全函数；$\\mathrm{Comp}_k$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","